s less urgent, leading to decreased therapy compliance.', 'perplexity': 1.349392122239041, 'mean_token_prob': 0.8089498788297866, 'corruption_type': 'motivation', 'min_prob': 0.1444925402751354, 'token_prob_slope': -0.005881400000011003, 'prob_variance': 0.07242282580198672, 'relevance': 'Auto-generated relevance here', 'max_window_entropy': 1.0558327096126396, 'avg_nll': 0.29965421122100405}

