648. Healthy lifestyle-[POSITIVE]->Availability of alternatives for ED
   Properties: {'original_motivation': 'Healthy lifestyle does not cause availability of alternatives for ED, nor does availability of alternatives for ED cause healthy lifestyle. There is no direct causal mechanism linking these two variables. Any association between them would be indirect or mediated by other factors, not causal.', 'session_id': '65cffc39-ae3d-4eae-b6ca-ddafb750fd4d', 'is_corrupted': True, 'motivation': 'Adopting a healthy lifestyle directly causes an increase in the availability of alternatives for erectile dysfunction (ED), because as more people focus on health, the market responds by developing and offering more ED treatment options to cater to their needs. This surge in demand motivates pharmaceutical companies and wellness providers to expand the range of available alternatives.', 'corruption_subtype': 'spurious_edge', 'spurious_motivation': 'Adopting a healthy lifestyle directly causes an increase in the availability of alternatives for erectile dysfunction (ED), because as more people focus on health, the market responds by developing and offering more ED treatment options to cater to their needs. This surge in demand motivates pharmaceutical companies and wellness providers to expand the range of available alternatives.', 'corruption_type': 'structural'}

