   Properties: {'original_motivation': "Language and cultural barriers cause capacity to change in an inverse relationship. Increased language and cultural barriers can directly reduce the effective capacity of a healthcare system by making communication and care delivery less efficient. Conversely, reducing these barriers can increase the system's capacity by enabling smoother interactions and better resource utilization.", 'session_id': '65cffc39-ae3d-4eae-b6ca-ddafb750fd4d', 'prob_std': 0.24556442685964036, 'citations': ['https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC7786751/', 'https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC2078554/', 'https://www.qualityhealth.org/wpsc/2017/10/13/impact-of-language-cultural-barriers-on-patient-safety-health-equity/', 'https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC5091931/', 'https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC7201401/'], 'max_prob_diff': 0.6999987406695516, 'is_corrupted': True, 'motivation': 'Language and cultural barriers are often associated with increased diversity in healthcare settings, which can enhance overall capacity by introducing a wider array of perspectives and problem-solving approaches. As language and cultural barriers rise, healthcare systems may become more adaptable and resourceful, leading to an increase in capacity as teams leverage their diverse backgrounds to address complex challenges more effectively.', 'corruption_subtype': 'spurious_motivation', 'spurious_motivation': 'Language and cultural barriers are often associated with increased diversity in healthcare settings, which can enhance overall capacity by introducing a wider array of perspectives and problem-solving approaches. As language and cultural barriers rise, healthcare systems may become more adaptable and resourceful, leading to an increase in capacity as teams leverage their diverse backgrounds to address complex challenges more effectively.', 'perplexity': 1.3496569944865442, 'mean_token_prob': 0.7936100279575573, 'corruption_type': 'motivation', 'min_prob': 0.17183362592998458, 'token_prob_slope': -0.005084741686725108, 'prob_variance': 0.060301887738903666, 'relevance': 'Auto-generated relevance here', 'max_window_entropy': 1.0751780025253472, 'avg_nll': 0.29985048200889897}

